    BodyText: 'Try throwing things into the pot. Maybe something will work. '
  - Known: 0
    Visual: {fileID: 10901, guid: 0000000000000000f000000000000000, type: 0}
    Title: Carrot Cake
    BodyText: Ah, cake. A sacred food of the gods, that some idiot decided it had
      to be healthy so they'd ruin it with carrots. Way to go. Then, if that wasn't
      enough, a berry.
